tests/differential_oracle.rs::oracle_corpus_agrees_across_backends	differential oracle — run with --test differential_oracle -- --ignored
tests/format_width_is_bounded.rs::a_positive_width_still_pads	no `ulimit -v` on Windows; the cap is the guard
tests/format_width_is_bounded.rs::a_width_below_zero_pads_nothing	no `ulimit -v` on Windows; the cap is the guard
tests/fuzz_differential.rs::keyed_generated_agree_across_backends	F3 differential (rustc per program) — run with --features fuzzing --ignored
tests/host_call.rs::measure_call_cost	a measurement, not a gate
tests/issues.rs::regen_fill_rs	maintenance: regenerates src/fill.rs — run manually when default/*.loft changes
